2973
03:11:55,680 --> 03:11:56,640
Okay, I can...

2974
03:11:56,640 --> 03:11:57,120
Ooh, nice.

2975
03:11:57,120 --> 03:11:58,200
This is a good start.

2976
03:11:59,660 --> 03:12:00,360
