2977
03:12:11,020 --> 03:12:12,440
In fact, I don't even need to jump up.

2978
03:12:12,580 --> 03:12:13,480
I can watch this.

2979
03:12:13,580 --> 03:12:14,300
I can shoot blindly.

2980
03:12:18,570 --> 03:12:19,330
